<title>GERMANY: German ZEW details 6-mth major nations forecasts.</title>
<headline>German ZEW details 6-mth major nations forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>MANNHEIM, Germany 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following table lists the economic and market forecasts for the six months from October 23, issued by the ZEW Zentrum fuer Europaeische Wirtschaftsforschung GmbH research institute. The averages are compiled from a survey of 303 firms conducted from October 7-22.</p>
<p>					  Base    Forecast</p>
<p>INFLATION RATES</p>
<p>    Germany			    1.4     1.5</p>
<p>    U.S.				 3.0     3.3</p>
<p>    Japan			     -0.4    -0.2</p>
<p>    Britain			    2.1     2.2</p>
<p>    France			     1.6     1.7</p>
<p>    Italy				3.4     3.4</p>
<p>SHORT-TERM RATES (Three-month interbank rates)</p>
<p>    Germany			    3.1     3.1</p>
<p>    U.S.				 5.0     5.4</p>
<p>    Japan				0.5     0.8</p>
<p>    Britain			    5.9     6.0</p>
<p>    France			     3.5     3.5</p>
<p>    Italy				8.1     8.0</p>
<p>LONG-TERM RATES</p>
<p>    Germany			    6.0     6.3</p>
<p>    U.S.				 6.6     7.0</p>
<p>    Japan				2.8     3.2</p>
<p>    Britain			    7.5     7.7</p>
<p>    France			     5.9     6.1</p>
<p>    Italy				8.4     8.5</p>
<p>BOURSE</p>
<p>    German DAX		     2,710   2,810</p>
<p>    U.S. Dow Jones		 6,030   5,970</p>
<p>    Japan Nikkei		  21,300  22,400</p>
<p>    Britain FT-SE 100	    4,040   4,060</p>
<p>    France CAC-40		  2,160   2,260</p>
<p>    Italy MIBtel		   9,900  10,400</p>
<p>EXCHANGE RATES VS MARK</p>
<p>    Swiss franc		     1.22    1.20</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar		     1.54    1.61</p>
<p>    Japanese yen		    1.37    1.38</p>
<p>    British pound		   2.43    2.45</p>
<p>    French franc		    2.96    2.96</p>
<p>    Italian lira		    1.00    0.99</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
